<title>USA: Advanced Electronic sees higher year sales.</title>
<headline>Advanced Electronic sees higher year sales.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Advanced Electronic Support Products Inc said Friday it expects 1997 net sales of $15 million, an increase of $1.3 million from 1996.</p>
<p>Due to higher costs and a 63.3 percent increase in shares outstanding, it said, earnings for the year are expected to be $0.25-$0.30 per share, compared to $0.57 in 1996.</p>
